### Demo 4 — the deployed container
@fqdn = dab-session-29467.italynorth.azurecontainer.io
@host = http://{{fqdn}}:5000

### first call, always
GET {{host}}/health

### the API from the public name
GET {{host}}/api/policies?$first=3
GET {{host}}/api/claims

### OpenAPI — present in development mode, gone after promote-to-production.sh
GET {{host}}/api/openapi

### MCP: list the tools the agent can see
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "tools/list" }

### MCP: read through a typed tool — no SQL was generated by any model
POST {{host}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "read_records",
    "arguments": { "entity": "Claim", "filter": "status eq 'open'" }
  }
}
